```console
$ um run continue --help
Continue a run from selected steps

Usage: um run continue [OPTIONS] --from <STEP> <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Run ID

Options:
      --from <STEP>                    Reexecute from this step (repeatable; order is preserved)
      --workflow-commit <OID>          Use a replacement workflow commit
      --workflow-path <PATH>           Use a replacement canonical workflow path
      --expected-version <VERSION>     Require this positive run version at admission
      --wait                           Observe the run until it settles
      --timeout <DURATION>             Stop waiting after a positive duration (units: ms, s, m, or h)
      --json                           Print the run result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Useful Machinery requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
